# Publish ONLY the app files. Everything else (BRIEF.md, SYSTEM.md, screens/,
# test files) stays on the computer and does not go to GitHub.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!style.css
!app.js
!sw.js
!manifest.webmanifest
!icon.svg
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!README.md
!data.json
!fetch.py
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/update.yml
